189
00:12:28,670 --> 00:12:29,840
I don't remember.

190
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:31,480
I don't remember.

191
00:12:31,850 --> 00:12:32,510
Last night,

192
00:12:33,630 --> 00:12:34,960
