298
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:24,790
Anyway, the painting is right here.

299
00:19:24,790 --> 00:19:26,590
Are you going to look at it or not?

300
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:45,950
This... this...

301
00:19:45,970 --> 00:19:48,230
Was this flower already in the painting?

302
00:19:54,440 --> 00:19:55,240
No, it wasn't.

303
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:07,350
It just appeared.

304
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:09,160
Within three days,

305
00:20:10,240 --> 00:20:12,170
you made the osmanthus tree bloom.

306
00:20:13,550 --> 00:20:14,590
What do you mean?

307
00:20:14,790 --> 00:20:17,790
I just smelled your time

308
00:20:18,030 --> 00:20:20,920
being released from this flower.
